== Effects ==
* Spawns 15 random [[locusts]].

== Notes ==
* All locusts have an equal chance to be any of the 5 types.

== Strategy ==
* Using the '''Soul of Apollyon''' near an enemy can be dangerous: an explosive locust may spawn on it and immediately explode, damaging Isaac.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Hive Mind}}: Doubles the damage dealt by locusts.

